\caption{Per-model revision trajectory (complete-revision subset). T1 and T5 are mean evaluator levels. $\Delta$ is T5 $-$ T1. Surv.\ is the fraction of 120 trials per model where the model revised at all five turns. $^\dagger n = 2$; insufficient for reliable estimation.}
